      "raw": "<p>Had an odd item come up in a game yesterday, possibly a bug with the new Undo to Star of Turn mechanic?</p><p>On the Mars Base, both the Countdown and the Meteor Storm were in play. &nbsp;On my 1st hero&#39;s turn (Bunker), the countdown came up first and I said no to skipping my turn for it, then I said yes to skipping my turn for the Meteors, destroying that card and ending Bunker&#39;s turn (as expected). &nbsp;</p><p>On my 2nd hero&#39;s turn (SST) however, I was reconsidering leaving the Meteors in play, so clicked the Undo button, which gave me the choice of jumping back to Bunker&#39;s Start of Turn <em>or his Play a Card </em>phase. &nbsp;Not expecing to see the Play option there got me Intrigued, so I clicked Bunker&#39;s Play a Card and the game put me into Bunker&#39;s Play phase <em>with the Meteor Storm still destroyed. &nbsp;</em>The game then let me continue with the free play &amp; power from Bunker.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
