      "created_at": "2015-07-28T12:47:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had that happen, only I rewound to the start of the turn -- I had Legacy skip his turn to remove the Meteor Shower, then realized Expatriette just drew her Rocket Launcher and decided to let her handle it instead. So I rewound to the start of Legacy's turn, Meteor Shower stayed destroyed, but it let me do all his phases.</p>",
